          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mcaka ca 15 ca ucimwene wa Amasiya, mwanace jwa Yowashi, mwenye jwa ku Yuda, Yelobowamu mwanace jwa Yehowashi, mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli, ŵajinjile ucimwene ku Samaliya, nipo ŵalamulile kwa yaka 41. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakweju ŵatendaga yindu yakusakala, yakwalemwecesya AMBUJE. Nganaleka kutenda yakusakala yiŵatendaga Yelobowamu ambujegwe, mwanace jwa Nebati yiŵalemwesye nayo Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵayisumwile soni yilambo yiyaliji m'myala mwa cilambo ca Isalaeli, kutandila ku Mpata wa Hamati kumpoto mpaka kum'mwela kuja kwika ku Nyasa ja Njete. Yatendekwe yindu yeleyi mpela muŵaŵecetele AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Isalaeli, kupitila mwa jwakutumicila jwawo, Yona mwanace jwa Amitayi, jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwa ku Gati Hefala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
