            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masengo gane giŵatesile Mwenye Yelobowamu jwaŵili, camnopemnope ya macili gakwe, muŵaputilaga ngondo, ni muŵasumulile soni misinda ja Damasiko ni Hamati ni kujiwucisya soni misindajo ku cilambo ca Isalaeli, yosopeyi yilembedwe m'buku ja Mbili ja Ayimwene ŵa ku Isalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Yelobowamu ŵawile nipo ŵamsicile m'malembe ga ucimwene ku Yelusalemu. Nipo Sakaliya mwanagwe ŵajinjile ucimwene m'malo mwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.29"
            ]
          }
